  <FAQSection faqs={faqs}/>

  <h2 id="recommendations">Final Recommendations by Team Size</h2>

  <h3>For Individuals & Freelancers</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Google Drive</strong> (15GB free, $1.99/mo for 100GB) is perfect for most people. If you value privacy,
    upgrade to <strong>Sync.com</strong> ($8/mo for 2TB with zero-knowledge encryption). If you want to pay once,
    <strong>pCloud's lifetime plan</strong> ($399 for 2TB) is unbeatable long-term value.
  </p>

  <h3>For Small Teams (2-10 people)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Google Workspace</strong> ($6-12/user/mo) includes Drive, Gmail, Docs, Meet, and Calendar - everything a
    small team needs. If you're already on Microsoft 365, <strong>OneDrive for Business</strong> is the obvious choice.
  </p>

  <h3>For Growing Teams (10-50 people)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Google Workspace</strong> or <strong>Microsoft 365</strong> depending on your preferred ecosystem. Both
    scale well and offer robust admin controls. If file syncing is critical, consider <strong>Dropbox Business</strong>
    ($15/user/mo) for the best sync experience.
  </p>

  <h3>For Enterprises (50+ people)</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Google Workspace Enterprise</strong>, <strong>Microsoft 365 Enterprise</strong>, or <strong>Box</strong>
    depending on your compliance needs. All three offer unlimited storage, advanced security, and enterprise admin
    features.
  </p>

  <h3>For Privacy-Conscious Users</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>Sync.com</strong> ($8/mo for 2TB) or <strong>pCloud with Crypto</strong> ($524 lifetime for 2TB + crypto)
    offer zero-knowledge encryption where even the provider can't access your files.
  </p>

  <h3>For Apple Users</h3>
  <p>
    <strong>iCloud</strong> is the obvious choice for seamless integration. $0.99/mo for 50GB, $2.99/mo for 200GB, or
    $9.99/mo for 2TB. Perfect for photos, device backups, and syncing across iPhone/iPad/Mac.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-8"><strong>Bottom line:</strong> For most remote workers, <strong>Google Drive</strong> (free or
    $1.99-9.99/mo) is the best choice for collaboration and value. If you're in the Microsoft ecosystem, <strong>OneDrive</strong>
    with Microsoft 365 is unbeatable. For maximum privacy, choose <strong>Sync.com</strong>. For one-time payment,
    <strong>pCloud lifetime</strong> is incredible value.</p>

